# Implementation Plan — Merchant New Order Decision Modal & Queue (PR 2)

Implementing the interactive decision modal and queue inside the merchant portal.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Real-time Synchronization**
> When a new order notification arrives via Supabase Realtime, `NotificationHub` will automatically invalidate the pending orders cache. This will instantly refresh the list and prompt the merchant layout to show the modal or update the pending orders count banner.

