### Frontend State & Queue Management

#### [NEW] [use-pending-orders.ts](file:///E:/Project/DilMart-Store/src/hooks/use-pending-orders.ts)
- Custom hook that fetches pending orders (where `status = 'new'` and `merchant_decision_status = 'pending'`).
- Exposes:
  - `pendingOrders`: list of pending orders.
  - `count`: total count of pending orders.
  - `currentOrder`: first order in the queue.
  - `isLoading`: loading status.
  - `refetch`: refresh function.

#### [MODIFY] [NotificationHub.tsx](file:///E:/Project/DilMart-Store/src/components/NotificationHub.tsx)
- Invalidate `["pending-merchant-orders", merchantId]` query on `onMerchantInsert` when `row.type === 'new_order'`.

