### Frontend UI Components

#### [NEW] [MerchantDecisionModal.tsx](file:///E:/Project/DilMart-Store/src/components/merchant/MerchantDecisionModal.tsx)
- Responsive modal showing:
  - Order number and created time.
  - Total price and payment method.
  - Number of items + list of items (names, price, quantity).
  - Multi-page layout:
    - **Page 1: Overview**: Shows order details + Accept / Reject / View Details buttons.
    - **Page 2: Rejection Reasons**: List of 11 reasons with radio buttons + Cancel / Confirm Rejection buttons.
  - "عرض التفاصيل" (View Details) button: Closes the modal and navigates to `/merchant/orders/:id`.

#### [MODIFY] [MerchantLayout.tsx](file:///E:/Project/DilMart-Store/src/components/MerchantLayout.tsx)
- Integrate the `usePendingOrders` hook.
- Display a floating/sticky top banner if there are pending orders:
  - Text: `لديك {count} طلبات بانتظار القرار` (You have {count} orders waiting for decision).
  - Button: `مراجعة الطلبات` (Review Orders) which opens the modal.
- On initial load: automatically open the modal if the merchant is on the overview page (`/merchant`) and there is at least one pending order.

